            <div xml:id="d640">

                <pb facs="0657" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg645"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/14317: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-08-25T00:00:00+03:00">August 25, 1941—12
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 25—11:09 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1570. I am reliably informed that the Soviet authorities ordered the evacuation
                    of all children from Moscow not later than August 25 and from the suburban area
                    within a radius of approximately 30 miles of the city not later than August
                    28.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
